        "id": 17809,
        "quiz_id": 4812,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "In spite of the advances made in agriculture, many people around the world still go hungry. Why is this the case? What can done about this problem?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RB0pdp4vGon41mxmxkQls4tkgGf\"><em><strong>In spite of the advances made in agriculture, many people around the world still go hungry. Why is this the case? What can done about this problem?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - World Hunger Despite Agriculture Debate&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G7DzdlxwOopQbcxrPjUlGt9MgUR\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề World Hunger Despite Agriculture Debate&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Mặc d&ugrave; c&oacute; những tiến bộ trong n&ocirc;ng nghiệp, nhiều người tr&ecirc;n thế giới vẫn phải chịu đ&oacute;i.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CABAds0npoPtPSxGWBolJqxrg7g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời 2 c&acirc;u hỏi trực tiếp: <em>Tại sao họ nghĩ như vậy? C&oacute; thể l&agrave;m g&igrave; để thay đổi quan điểm của họ?</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UF56dRixmoabouxfrLPl1Oocgtf\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i World Hunger Despite Agriculture Debate&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M3m9dnD4Mo5g5YxqjFIlVDLugub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A96cdjFzUo57ZuxZQ0glVvMFgCf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EH28dFcQgoM8nFx5rfolcjlfg0e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FfjwdfJGvosO0yxb1bZl4DWigDg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>agricultural advances <em>(tiến bộ n&ocirc;ng nghiệp)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JMXydIpYCoeNsDxjQE5lSY8pgMf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>remain a persistent global issue <em>(vấn đề to&agrave;n cầu dai dẳng)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQrod7PLVoVsK1x2Z2nlwBXdgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>necessitate urgent action <em>(cần h&agrave;nh động khẩn cấp)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GdyRdbsZvoIxiwxeyISlrvrvgTq\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoFxd6G5IosqkDxxr7IlYJpdgkg\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EB3zdgSE8oDcK3x9P4DlIpWAgZe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HzOidr8ZxoTPSFxUkoXlvE4NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5bHdyGhgoMPdixKUZYlMlHwgRh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AQZSdgBLBobdFaxUWOollK9xgGg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdErd68GhozyUKxzMBbl7ZM1gGg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jyq4dGw0Gow9ITxtBq6lWihYgCd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch l&yacute; do tại sao d&ugrave; ng&agrave;nh n&ocirc;ng nghiệp đ&atilde; c&oacute; nhiều bước ph&aacute;t triển, nhưng vẫn c&ograve;n rất nhiều người tr&ecirc;n thế giới sống trong cảnh thiếu lương thực..</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQXDdrMYvoYyyIxSL99l8H0CgHV\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Đề xuất giải ph&aacute;p gi&uacute;p giải quyết vấn đề về nạn đ&oacute;i.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEQ0dwS7nowPZExW2i9l8z0vgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OLymdBW54ogutCx2USClYflAgPf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ErfadJPNhoGippx8HFylh5IGgxe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=161\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFbjddKqRoA9AbxpHWPlVjUXgbe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=162\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PCV9deP2nouqvrxg8eUlsNuegXd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=645\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J20Yds7vLoEOrrxK31XleiYqgtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong><strong>Đưa ra lập luận r&otilde; nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n v&igrave; sao t&igrave;nh trạng thiếu lương thực vẫn tồn tại tr&ecirc;n thế giới, d&ugrave; lĩnh vực n&ocirc;ng nghiệp đ&atilde; đạt được nhiều th&agrave;nh tựu.</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EXi9dNJPZoaAt4xObz4lEdwPg0U\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-c05bf56a-7fff-fdd0-dcff-a485e3824b48\"></strong></strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TvJGd3R4zoECjjxyRoOl2efgguc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VkpUdS4fwovSvPx9UywlQao3gLb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlihdFPJuoTdewxs8hOlbfNFgPL\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAtJdZPu5okOZUxf8TslkFSsgZ7\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>C&oacute; một số l&yacute; do tại sao ti&ecirc;u chuẩn sống đ&ocirc; thị đ&atilde; xấu đi trong những năm gần đ&acirc;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OwFAd0PNEo4IKExXDzylPtVOgrh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PegadZsNUo15aMxdV8Zlaq2ugKd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: <em>sự suy tho&aacute;i về m&ocirc;i trường (environmental degradation)</em> do kh&iacute; thải từ &ocirc; t&ocirc; v&agrave; c&aacute;c<em> nh&agrave; m&aacute;y c&ocirc;ng nghiệp (industrial plants)</em> đ&atilde; dẫn đến &ocirc; nhiễm kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; nghi&ecirc;m trọng --&gt; Cư d&acirc;n th&agrave;nh phố mắc <em>c&aacute;c bệnh về đường h&ocirc; hấp (respiratory diseases) </em>v&agrave; nhiều vấn đề sức khỏe kh&aacute;c.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAmUdyGavokr60xHGHqlLihygEg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>&nbsp;V&iacute; dụ,<em> lớp sương kh&oacute;i d&agrave;y đặc (thick smog) </em>thường xuy&ecirc;n bao phủ c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố lớn như Bắc Kinh hay Delhi khiến mọi người kh&oacute; thở kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; trong l&agrave;nh h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O4Ovdm22Eo3LHGxhGQ7l3Xiwgwh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YPIadKbLGo3InQxb1MMlHH29gAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> <em>&aacute;p lực kinh tế&nbsp; (economic pressures)</em> đ&atilde; gia tăng&nbsp;do <em>đất đai hạn chế (limited land availability) </em>ở trung t&acirc;m th&agrave;nh phố.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FytGdMdXJo5gx0xgK9BlffmPgwc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> gi&aacute; nh&agrave; đ&atilde; <em>tăng vọt (skyrocket)</em> v&agrave; những người trẻ kh&ocirc;ng thể <em>chi trả được chỗ ở tử tế (afford decent accommodation)</em>. Điều n&agrave;y buộc họ phải sống trong điều kiện qu&aacute; đ&ocirc;ng đ&uacute;c hoặc chuyển xa nơi l&agrave;m việc, l&agrave;m <em>giảm chất lượng cuộc sống của họ (reducing their quality of life).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ogajd9kkooYFT7xqNLelwX9Agah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PTcddY6Kqo7nHcxFb3UlpLsggud\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Viết BODY 2: </strong><strong>Đưa ra c&aacute;c biện ph&aacute;p khả thi nhằm khắc phục v&agrave; giải quyết vấn đề đ&oacute;i ngh&egrave;o to&agrave;n cầu.</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PAdkdXWAZox058xLZ0GltyzUg7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-5fa341e6-7fff-6f64-db06-d3e979d105ee\"></strong></strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tz5cdshVeoUlfIxSjcZl6FyEgib\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcXEdRhnVoQ3oyx0pqcl1k7GgMb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I7wVdxu0voPLSOxyXztlxBwcgdb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBZgdUejJoyWuhxQvKelKRTsgMg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYtUdKqiZo7GDqxjHxKlWvi2gVb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng c&oacute; một số biện ph&aacute;p hiệu quả c&oacute; thể giải quyết vấn đề cấp b&aacute;ch n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SbgEd3Ty5oTbO0xzNS2l0rMdgyg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UpzNdB5SQoO2j8x16VMle5aQglb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Một giải ph&aacute;p l&agrave;<em> thực hiện chương tr&igrave;nh viện trợ của ch&iacute;nh phủ (implementing government aid programs) </em>v&agrave; <em>trợ cấp thực phẩm (food subsidies). </em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-So2EduBiZoe9Tzx7vJllE4Ulgpe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact</strong>: Ch&iacute;nh phủ c&oacute; thể cung cấp thực phẩm miễn ph&iacute; cho c&aacute;c gia đ&igrave;nh ngh&egrave;o, điều n&agrave;y l&agrave;m giảm <strong>khủng hoảng đ&oacute;i (hunger crisis) </strong>v&agrave; cho ph&eacute;p trẻ em tập trung v&agrave;o gi&aacute;o dục thay v&igrave; t&igrave;m kiếm thức ăn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OiVLdwrfVon4wHxoG3Hl9DjIglf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J9UvdobZJowYBgxnTe5ljRrsgyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Một giải ph&aacute;p kh&aacute;c l&agrave; ph&aacute;t triển <em>c&acirc;y trồng chịu hạn (drought-resistant crops)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua c&ocirc;ng nghệ ti&ecirc;n tiến.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JxgOdQrEdopOHVxo2WVlO9qtg0e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> C&aacute;c nh&agrave; khoa học c&oacute; thể tạo ra những loại c&acirc;y trồng sống s&oacute;t trong điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt, chẳng hạn như <em>gạo biến đổi gen (genetically modified rice) </em>ph&aacute;t triển với &iacute;t nước hơn, gi&uacute;p n&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n <em>duy tr&igrave; sản xuất ổn định (maintain stable production) </em>trong <em>thảm họa kh&iacute; hậu (climate disasters).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-BHVjdZmI0oMKnrxn4CtlTdn5gUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5. Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zu8ndrXoDo0OKIxJZtgljemhguh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EMN7dAA9ronLeRxOw4XlmhQIgmd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xoitd0UzQoDp1xxHOunlKjhIgrf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KhHndXqLgoCSjQxkGzAljeoLgyc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EJS0dLGEYoJik0xOC7AlK5AMgmc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fe92do18Eoi53nxEDgSlW3Gqg4b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LbntdBk2TojZ9qxFXlrlviWpgMg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>armed conflicts <em>(xung đột vũ trang)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FhPFdYRgmokdglxJfbslzTJTgch\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">targeted government support <em>(hỗ trợ ch&iacute;nh phủ c&oacute; mục đ&iacute;ch)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1427,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RCG4dE4aBorIOhxIHz4leR0Ogxh\">Despite significant agricultural advances, hunger remains a persistent global issue affecting millions of people worldwide. This alarming situation can be attributed to several factors that necessitate urgent action from governments and the international community.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17809,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1428,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RCG4dE4aBorIOhxIHz4leR0Ogxh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SPcYd8CtBo2eCRxuTrylsapBg2g\"><strong>There are two main reasons why people continue to suffer from hunger despite improved farming techniques.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">First, political conflicts and wars severely disrupt food supply chains. Wars destroy farmland and infrastructure, making it impossible for farmers to cultivate crops safely, which ultimately leads to food production dropping dramatically and food distribution becoming impossible.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Second, climate change significantly affects crop production. Rising temperatures and irregular rainfall damage crops because farmers lose entire harvests to droughts and floods, resulting in millions facing starvation despite the existence of a global food surplus.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17809,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1429,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbY3dtdXEoXKHHxE459li6gpgTc\"><strong>However, I believe there are several effective measures that can address this pressing problem.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">One solution is implementing government aid programs and food subsidies. Governments can provide free food to poor families, which reduces the immediate hunger crisis and allows children to focus on education instead of searching for food.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Another solution involves developing drought-resistant crops through advanced technology. Scientists can create crops that survive extreme weather conditions, such as genetically modified rice that grows with less water, enabling farmers to maintain stable production during climate disasters.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17809,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1430,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HRobds3tfoPGjcx3LnElrwSAggH\">In conclusion, hunger persists primarily due to armed conflicts and climate-related challenges. Nevertheless, through targeted government support and agricultural innovation, this critical issue can be effectively addressed.</div>\n</div>",
